From e5c3e3271301cdf849209ae024992ff6c41d96c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: danste22 <daniel@steinhauf.eu>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 10:27:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] board: turing: pi2: Turing Pi 2 BMC support

Add the TP2 board, EEPROM/bloblist handoff, FIT config from hw_version,
and EEPROM-authoritative MAC (SID fallback only if EEPROM has none).
Release the RTL8370MB from reset; Linux DSA owns isolation over GPIO SMI.
On v2.5+ only, expand the OF_EMBED ubi partition to 255 MiB before UBI env
attach. v2.3/v2.4 and missing EEPROM keep the 127 MiB map (128 MiB NAND).

Signed-off-by: danste22 <daniel@steinhauf.eu>
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
